@ 0 1 0 15a2f032bb2d416f1f9e73c7938145ec
+       limit/2.kib             // 2048.0

@ 0 1 0 1ff93883786571760b6eb8b6071fe709
+       (limit + 1.kib).long    // 4195328

@ 1 1 0 17ec48607ef8899c1bf9c9ede6ea7df6
+       ```

